{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114508","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114508/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114508/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114508/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114508","id":3775152992,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7hBENg","number":114508,"title":"Incorrect generated tangents on mirrored UVs in glTF import","user":{"login":"zeux","id":1106629,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMDY2Mjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1106629?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux","html_url":"https://github.com/zeux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zeux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-01-01T20:21:27Z","updated_at":"2026-07-01T15:37:04Z","closed_at":"2026-07-01T15:36:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: latest master (a8ebeb4ddae0f9cd91fcb58239b2974bf15873be)\n\n### System information\n\nUbuntu Linux 25.10 - NVidia GeForce 5070\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot uses MikkTSpace to generate tangents via `SurfaceTool::generate_tangents()`, however the way it uses it is only correct if the surface data is not indexed. The library explicitly advises against using the existing index list to implement `setTSpaceBasic`:\n\n```\n\t// But averaging/overwriting tangent spaces by using an already existing index list WILL produce INCRORRECT results.\n\t// DO NOT! use an already existing index list.\n```\n\n... but that's exactly what SurfaceTool does when the index list is present. glTF (and FBX?) importers happen to call `generate_tangents` after reindexing the geometry which guarantees incorrect behavior in certain cases.\n\nWhen UVs are mirrored, but the vertex doesn't have duplicates in the input buffer, the vertex should have two different tangents, pointing in opposite directions; this requires duplicating the vertex on the mirror seam. What instead happens is that one of the tangents gets ignored and one gets written to the vertex buffer, producing tangent artifacts in the triangles along the mirror seam because tangents with opposite directions are interpolated.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThe easiest way to see this issue is to look at the tangents directly. I've adjusted Godot's normal debugging mode to do that with the following patch: [tangent-debug.patch](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24402824/tangent-debug.patch)\n\nWith that patch, importing the MRP (using asset from https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/male-character-3-da7723ef494e4627869bba6f4d65577f, adjusted to remove tangent data to trigger tangent generation during glTF import), it's easy to see the issue on the mirror seam on the character's hat:\n\n<img width=\"753\" height=\"727\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88adeac3-a482-4f2f-9da5-c77d47b73f21\" />\n\nHere's how the tangents *should* look like (this is generated by patching glTF importer to de-index and re-index the surface before/after tangent generation):\n\n<img width=\"753\" height=\"727\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b6a3abcb-1b86-43d3-9ee1-0acd99a072a4\" />\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[godot-tangent-mirroring.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24402846/godot-tangent-mirroring.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114508/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114508/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}